en-US.longDescription:
BiliMaku is a desktop livestream companion built with React, Rust, and Tauri 2, featuring danmaku (bullet-chat) text-to-speech and scrolling displays.

Features

- QR-code login with local session restore;
- Connect to a livestream room and receive danmaku, gifts, Super Chats, guard memberships, and interaction events;
- Read messages aloud with the system voice or a local Bert-VITS2 custom voice;
- Full-screen scrolling danmaku and a transparent side floating event window;
- Light mode, dark mode, and WebGL interface effects.
The release package does not include PyTorch, BERT, voice weights, or user cookies.
